    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d615-a2">

                <pb facs="0965" n="939" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v16/pg939"/>


                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >confidential</hi></seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Proposal of the U.K. Delegation</hi></p>
                <p>In order to facilitate the early <hi rendition="#underline">and simultaneous</hi>
                    cessation of hostilities [<del rendition="#strikethrough">it</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">is</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">necessary</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">to</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">determine</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">the</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">areas</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">within</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">which</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">the</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">forces</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">of</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">both</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">sides</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">shall</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">be</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">regrouped.</del></p>
                <p><del rendition="#strikethrough">To</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">this</del>
                    <del rendition="#strikethrough">end</del>]<anchor n="4" xml:id="d615-f1"/> it is
                    proposed that: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Representatives of the two commands should meet immediately in Geneva
                                <hi rendition="#underline">in order that this should also contribute
                                to the establishment of contacts between the two parties on the
                                spot.</hi></item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>Their first task should be to work out the regrouping areas for
                            Vietnam [<del rendition="#strikethrough">the</del>
                            <del rendition="#strikethrough">two</del>
                            <del rendition="#strikethrough">sides</del>
                            <del rendition="#strikethrough">and</del>
                            <del rendition="#strikethrough">first</del>
                            <del rendition="#strikethrough">of</del>
                            <del rendition="#strikethrough">all</del>
                            <del rendition="#strikethrough">for</del>
                            <del rendition="#strikethrough">Vietnam</del>]<anchor n="4"
                                xml:id="d615-f2"/>.</item>
                        <label>3.</label>
                        <item>They should report their findings and recommendations to the
                            conference as soon as possible.</item>
                        <pb facs="0966" n="940" xml:id="pg940"/>
                        <label>4.</label>
                        <item>The conference meanwhile should proceed with examination of other
                            military matters, beginning with arrangements for international
                            supervision.</item>
                    </list></p>
            </div>
